    "title_en": "Probability, Curvature and Spectrum on Graphs",
    "abstract_en": "We show that, for a metric graph equipped with the Laplacian operator $Δ=-\\frac{d^2}{dx^2}$, the graph trace formula admits a new interpretation in terms of quantum probability and curvature. Our approach is based on a notion of graph curvature inspired by Wilson-lines and holonomy, together with von-Neumann's ergodic theorem.",
